# Training run outputs (produced by `rlbench train`; reproducible, not tracked).
# NOTE: results/ and reports/ are intentionally NOT ignored -- they are the
# committed, content-addressed audit evidence for the SnakeGo Task-10 study
# (results/snakego/SHA256SUMS pins every file) and are required by the
# reproducibility tests and the release extractor. Do not delete or gitignore
# them. A redundant backup lives under
# experiments-data/rl-runs/AgentBenchRL-snakego-task10/.
runs/

